 "_about": [
  "The four canonical levels are a US high-school ladder, inherited from the TESS",
  "layer. They carry UK qualifications better than expected: a British first degree",
  "and an American bachelor's land together, GCSEs and a high school diploma land",
  "together. That makes the UK and US layers comparable at no cost, which is the",
  "whole point of the project and was not guaranteed.",
  "",
  "Seven UK studies share one YouGov 18-level scheme covering 83% of UK rows, so",
  "the work was mapping three outliers into it rather than inventing a new ladder.",
  "SocSci210 itself harmonises nothing — sampling six of its studies returns one",
  "vocabulary because nearly every TESS study used the same US panel vendor. Our",
  "corpus is the same shape, and the same strategy applies: translate the minority.",
  "",
  "A fifth canonical value exists for LOGVPZ alone. Read its note below before",
  "adding anything else to the canonical list.",
  "",
  "uk_k7tw5_osf (26 Oct 2026, IMG02, revised after the independent check): six UK qualification levels.",
  "Three of them each SPAN canonical levels: \"Up to 4 GCSEs (any grades)\" includes low CSE grades (less than high school to",
  "high school), \"5 or more GCSEs or 1 A-level (incl. Apprenticeship)\" and \"2 or more A-levels (incl. ONC, OND, BTEC National,",
  "NVQ3)\" reach some college. Mapping any of them to High school would split them, so all three go to \"Below degree level (not",
  "further distinguished)\", the existing merged value. Post-graduate goes to Bachelors to postgraduate. \"Bachelor’s degree",
  "(Including ... HNC, HND ...)\" also spans (some college to bachelors) but no merged value covers it; mapped by its headline to",
  "Bachelors to postgraduate, a disclosed judgement (1,293 people). \"Other vocational/work-related qualifications\" Jev declined;",
  "mapped Some college to associate as UKHLS maps \"Other qualification\". No canonical value added; no other scheme changed.",
  "",
  "uk_pr8zu_osf (28 Oct 2026, IMG01): the k7tw5 lab's alcohol sibling, same instrument. Its six labels (after the same",
  "Bachelor mojibake repair) are the same strings as uk_k7tw5_osf's, checked by set equality in code; mapping copied, the",
  "Bachelor's headline judgement included. No canonical value added."
 ]
}
